  "notes": "{下|くだ}さい is used for polite requests.\n\nPATTERNS:\n- noun + を + {下|くだ}さい (please give me ~)\n- te-form + {下|くだ}さい (please do ~)\n\nFORMALITY:\n- 〜て{下|くだ}さい (polite request)\n- 〜てください (polite, hiragana writing common)\n- お〜{下|くだ}さい (more formal)\n\nORIGIN: Imperative form of {下|くだ}さる (to give - honorific).",
